# Only the scripts and this README are source. Everything a dataset consists of
# -- the unpacked DwC-A and all that is derived from it -- stays untracked:
# gigabytes of media, a generated gallery, API caches.
#
# The patterns are deliberately name-agnostic, so they hold whether a dataset
# sits at the repo root or in its own subdirectory:
#     ./dwca/            or    chrysomelidae/dwca/
#     ./media/                 chrysomelidae/media/

dwca/
media/
gallery/
taxonomy/

# The original iDigBio download.
*.zip

# LibreOffice lock files, left behind when a CSV is open in a spreadsheet.
.~lock.*#

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
